{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15969","headline":"饮马长城窟 · 王建","name":"饮马长城窟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长城窟，长城窟边多马骨。\n古来此地无井泉，赖得秦家筑城卒。\n征人饮马愁不回，长城变作望乡堆。\n蹄踪未乾人去近，续後马来泥污尽。\n枕弓睡着待水生，不见阴山在前阵。\n马蹄足脱装马头，健儿战死谁封侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15969.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15969","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}